n- Improves my piece coordination\n\nReason: In a materially losing position, I need to create immediate threats and activity. Attacking Black's Queen with N: b1-c3 forces Black to respond to my threat rather than execute their own plans. This knight move develops my piece with tempo, which is critical when behind in material.\n\nAnswer: N: b1-c3"}
